<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>NBD Lab 2</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 40rem; margin: 4rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; color: #222; }
    code { background: #f3f3f3; padding: 0.1rem 0.3rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>NBD Lab 2: nginx &rarr; Fluent Bit &rarr; OpenSearch</h1>
  <p>Every request to this page is written by nginx as one JSON line to
     <code>{{ nginx_access_log }}</code>, shipped by Fluent Bit and stored in the
     <code>{{ logs_data_stream }}</code> data stream of the
     <code>{{ opensearch_cluster_name }}</code> cluster.</p>
  <p>Logs roll over at {{ logs_rollover_max_size }} or {{ logs_rollover_max_age }} and are deleted after {{ logs_delete_after }}.</p>
</body>
</html>
